### ==============================================================================
### ShopCraft API - Day 06: JWT Authentication & RBAC HTTP Verification
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 1. Register New Customer Account (Returns 201 Created & JWT Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer.test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "Test Customer"
}

### 2. Login as Customer (Returns 200 OK & Bearer Token)
# @name customerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@shopcraft.com",
  "password": "Customer123!"
}

### Store Customer Token
@customerToken = {{customerLogin.response.body.token}}

### 3. Login as Administrator (Returns 200 OK & Bearer Token)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@shopcraft.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Store Admin Token
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

### 4. Get Current User Profile (Requires Authentication)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 5. Browse Products (Public Access - No Token Required - Expect 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=0&size=5

### 6. Create Product as Anonymous (Expect 401 Unauthorized ProblemDetail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-ELC-7001",
  "name": "Anonymous Attempt Product",
  "price": 99.99,
  "stockQuantity": 10,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 7. Create Product as Customer (Expect 403 Forbidden ProblemDetail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-ELC-7002",
  "name": "Customer Attempt Product",
  "price": 99.99,
  "stockQuantity": 10,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 8. Create Product as Administrator (Expect 201 Created & Location Header)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-ELC-7003",
  "name": "Admin Authorized Gaming Monitor",
  "description": "High refresh rate IPS display",
  "price": 349.99,
  "stockQuantity": 15,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 9. Query Audit Trail as Customer (Expect 403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 10. Query Audit Trail as Administrator (Expect 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit-logs?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
